S_3(3,a) for every residue a mod 27, exact rationals
gbar_3(3) = 7/18

  a = 0 mod 3:  S = 0
  a = 1 mod 3:  S = 9/7
  a = 2 mod 3:  S = 12/7

S(a=1 mod 3) + S(a=2 mod 3) = 3
mean over the 18 units    = 3/2

Both check out. The identity is proved in main.tex's
rem:no-monotone-certificate; this script verifies it exactly
at the given level rather than asserting it.
